{"title":"Mathematics summer program","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Mathematics programs come in many varieties targeted at many different age groups and levels of students. These programs mostly take place during the summer, but some last during a significant portion of the academic year. Selection is important in creating the best experience for any math student.\n</p><p>Many of these programs are rather expensive. A few of the programs listed below offer <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">mathematics scholarships</a> or financial aid. A few of them are free. When you discover more that do, please add that information to any appropriate places you find in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a>.\n</p><p>Some of the math programs listed below have devoted  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=136\">AoPS forums</a> where students, teachers, and parents can discuss these programs.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Canadian_Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Canadian Programs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#European_Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">European Programs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#USA_Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">USA Programs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Math_programs_for_elementary_school_students\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Math programs for elementary school students</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Math_programs_for_middle_school_students\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Math programs for middle school students</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Math_summer_programs_for_high_school_students\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Math summer programs for high school students</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Online\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Online</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#In_Person\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">In Person</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Residential\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Residential</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Day\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Residential_and_Day/Commuter_Options\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Residential and Day/Commuter Options</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#In_Person_and_Online\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">In Person and Online</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Canadian_Programs\">Canadian Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Canadian Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=High_School_Math_Mentorship_Program\" title=\"High School Math Mentorship Program\">High School Math Mentorship Program</a> in Canada, operates out of University of Toronto. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathplus.math.utoronto.ca/home/mentorship/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quantum_School_for_Young_Students&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Quantum School for Young Students (page does not exist)\">Quantum School for Young Students</a> at the University of Waterloo, Waterloo, Ontario, Canada. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://uwaterloo.ca/institute-for-quantum-computing/qsys/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SHAD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"SHAD (page does not exist)\">SHAD</a> at university campuses across Canada. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.shad.ca/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seeing_Possibilities_and_Rewards_in_Computer_Science_(SPARCS)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Seeing Possibilities and Rewards in Computer Science (SPARCS) (page does not exist)\">Seeing Possibilities and Rewards in Computer Science (SPARCS)</a> hosted by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CEMC\">CEMC</a> (Centre for Education in Mathematics and Computing) affiliated with the University of Waterloo. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.uwaterloo.ca/events/sparcs.html/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Toronto_Summer_Math_Academy\" title=\"University of Toronto Summer Math Academy\">University of Toronto Summer Math Academy</a> at the University of Toronto, Toronto, Ontario, Canada. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathplus.math.utoronto.ca/home/ma/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"European_Programs\">European Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: European Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.fabric.camp/\">FABRIC</a> runs multiple camps per year - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://espr.camp/\">ESPR</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pair.camp/\">PAIR</a>, &amp; sometimes <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.warp.camp/\">WARP</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"USA_Programs\">USA Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: USA Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_programs_for_elementary_school_students\">Math programs for elementary school students</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Math programs for elementary school students\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A*_Summer_Math_Camp\" title=\"A* Summer Math Camp\">A* Summer Math Camp</a> in Bay Area, CA, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://alphastar.academy/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Areteem_Institute_Summer_Camp\" title=\"Areteem Institute Summer Camp\">Areteem Institute Summer Camp</a> (Fullerton and San Jose, CA; Chicago, Illinois, Washington DC), <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.areteem.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Academy\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving Academy\">Art of Problem Solving Academy</a> (Locations Nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aopsacademy.org/courses/schedule/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_in_the_Mountains_camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math in the Mountains camp (page does not exist)\">Math in the Mountains camp</a> (Jackson Hole, WY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.mathmountains.org/\">[1]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_Online_Summer_Program\" title=\"Beestar Online Summer Program\">Beestar Online Summer Program</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.beestar.org/news/news041015.jsp\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=C%26!_(Campersand)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"C&amp;! (Campersand) (page does not exist)\">C&amp;! (Campersand)</a> (Albuquerque, NM) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://campersand.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth_(CTY)\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth (CTY)\">Center for Talented Youth (CTY) </a> (Locations Nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Challenge_Math_Online_-_Noetic_Learning&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Challenge Math Online - Noetic Learning (page does not exist)\">Challenge Math Online - Noetic Learning</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.noetic-learning.com/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Online, Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Epsilon_Camp\" title=\"Epsilon Camp\">Epsilon Camp</a> (Location changes yearly) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.epsiloncamp.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Girls_Rock_Math&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Girls Rock Math (page does not exist)\">Girls Rock Math</a> (Seattle, WA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.girlsrockmathematics.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LeapAhead!_Online_Summer_Program\" title=\"LeapAhead! Online Summer Program\">LeapAhead! Online Summer Program</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.noetic-learning.com/summermath/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Contest_Camp\" title=\"Math Contest Camp\">Math Contest Camp</a> (Bolivar, MO) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/sbumathcon/math-contest-camp-2022\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Star_League_Summer_Camps_-_RESIDENTIAL_%26_DAY_CAMPS\" title=\"Star League Summer Camps - RESIDENTIAL &amp; DAY CAMPS\">Star League Summer Camps - RESIDENTIAL &amp; DAY CAMPS</a> (Irvine and Cupertino, CA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.starleague.us\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TenMarks_Education\" title=\"TenMarks Education\">TenMarks Education</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.tenmarks.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_Mathworks\" title=\"Texas Mathworks\">Texas Mathworks</a> (San Marcos, TX) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathworks.txstate.edu/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Random_Math\" title=\"Random Math\">Random Math </a> (Cupertino, CA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://randommath.com/summer-camps\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Russian_School_of_Mathematics_Summer_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Russian School of Mathematics Summer School (page does not exist)\">Russian School of Mathematics Summer School</a> (Locations nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.russianschool.com/our-programs/summer-school\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_programs_for_middle_school_students\">Math programs for middle school students</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Math programs for middle school students\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IITSP\" title=\"IITSP\">IITSP</a> (Online, hosted by IIT), <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imc-impea.org/IMC/bbs/content.php?co_id=iitsp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A*_Summer_Math_Camp\" title=\"A* Summer Math Camp\">A* Summer Math Camp</a> in Bay Area, CA, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://alphastar.academy/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Areteem_Institute_Summer_Camp\" title=\"Areteem Institute Summer Camp\">Areteem Institute Summer Camp</a> (Fullerton and San Jose, CA; Chicago, Illinois, Washington DC), <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.areteem.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Academy\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving Academy\">Art of Problem Solving Academy</a> (Locations Nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aopsacademy.org/courses/schedule/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/AwesomeMath\">AwesomeMath</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.awesomemath.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bard_Math_Circle_Creative_and_Analytical_Math_Program_(CAMP)\" title=\"Bard Math Circle Creative and Analytical Math Program (CAMP)\">Bard Math Circle Creative and Analytical Math Program (CAMP)</a> (Annandale-on-Hudson, NY), <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bardmathcircle.org/camp\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beestar_Online_Summer_Program\" title=\"Beestar Online Summer Program\">Beestar Online Summer Program</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.beestar.org/news/news041015.jsp\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=C%26!_(Campersand)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"C&amp;! (Campersand) (page does not exist)\">C&amp;! (Campersand)</a> (Albuquerque, NM) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://campersand.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/Center_for_Talented_Youth_(CTY)\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (Locations Nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Challenge_Math_Online_-_Noetic_Learning&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Challenge Math Online - Noetic Learning (page does not exist)\">Challenge Math Online - Noetic Learning</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.noetic-learning.com/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Online, Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data-detectives-camp/\">Data Detectives Summer Camp (College Park, MD)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://esp.mit.edu/web/home/index.html\">Educational Studies Program at MIT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IDEA_MATH_Summer_Program\" title=\"IDEA MATH Summer Program\">IDEA MATH Summer Program</a> (Cupertino, CA, Boston, MA, and Plano, TX) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://ideamath.org/summerprog.htm/\">Website</a> [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewforum.php?f=637\">Forum</a>]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IOMC_Math_Competition\" title=\"IOMC Math Competition\">IOMC Math Competition</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://internationalonlin8.wixsite.com/competition/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mindresearch.org/mathcamp/\">MIND Research Institute Math Camp</a> (Locations change yearly)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Contest_Camp\" title=\"Math Contest Camp\">Math Contest Camp</a> (Bolivar, MO) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/sbumathcon/math-contest-camp-2022\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathenrichment.net/\">Math Enrichment Summer Institute at San Jose University</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathLinks_Camp\" title=\"MathLinks Camp\">MathLinks Camp</a> (San Diego, CA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewforum.php?f=805\">Forum</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/Mathpath\">MathPath</a> (Location changes yearly) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewforum.php?f=443\">Forum</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathpath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li>Math-M-Addicts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://mathmaddicts.org/\">[2]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Competitive_Programming_Bootcamp\" title=\"MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp\">MehtA+ Competitive Programming Bootcamp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 7-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplus.com/courses/competitive-program/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Education_Program_for_Gifted_Youth\" title=\"Education Program for Gifted Youth\">Stanford Pre-Collegiate Summer Institutes</a>  (formerly the EPGY Summer Institutes) in California, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://summerinstitutes.stanford.edu/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Math_Camps_-_Camp_Conway\" title=\"National Math Camps - Camp Conway\">National Math Camps - Camp Conway</a> (Claremont, CA)  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nationalmathcamps.org/camp-conway/?utm_source=AoPS&amp;utm_medium=Website&amp;utm_campaign=NMC2026&amp;utm_content=Wiki\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Math_Camps_-_Camp_Sierpinski\" title=\"National Math Camps - Camp Sierpinski\">National Math Camps - Camp Sierpinski</a> (Raleigh, NC) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nationalmathcamps.org/camp-sierpinski/?utm_source=AoPS&amp;utm_medium=Website&amp;utm_campaign=NMC2026&amp;utm_content=Wiki\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Paquin_Institute_of_Mathematics\" title=\"Paquin Institute of Mathematics\">Paquin Institute of Mathematics</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.paquinmath.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Star_League_Math_Camps_-_RESIDENTIAL_%26_DAY_CAMPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Star League Math Camps - RESIDENTIAL &amp; DAY CAMPS\">Star League Math Camps - RESIDENTIAL &amp; DAY CAMPS</a> (Irvine and Cupertino, CA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://starleague.us/content/2018-summer-camps\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TenMarks_Education\" title=\"TenMarks Education\">TenMarks Education</a> (Online) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.tenmarks.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_Mathworks\" title=\"Texas Mathworks\">Texas Mathworks</a> (San Marcos, TX) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathworks.txstate.edu/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Young_Scholars_Program\" title=\"Young Scholars Program\">Young Scholars Program</a> (University of Chicago) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.uchicago.edu/ysp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Random_Math\" title=\"Random Math\">Random Math </a> (Cupertino, CA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://randommath.com/summer-camps\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Russian_School_of_Mathematics_Summer_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Russian School of Mathematics Summer School (page does not exist)\">Russian School of Mathematics Summer School</a> (Locations nationwide) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.russianschool.com/our-programs/summer-school\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_summer_programs_for_high_school_students\">Math summer programs for high school students</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Math summer programs for high school students\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Online\">Online</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_program&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Online\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Math_%26_Physics_Summer_Camp_(IMPSC)\" title=\"International Math &amp; Physics Summer Camp (IMPSC)\">International Math &amp; Physics Summer Camp (IMPSC)</a> online (Indian Institutes of Technology, IIT), <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imc-impea.org/IMC/bbs/board.php?bo_table=news&amp;wr_id=14/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AwesomeMath\" title=\"AwesomeMath\">AwesomeMath</a> online only at <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"externa